[1527.63245, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m  GNU nano 7.2                                                                                   phase-1-studentA.md *                                                                                           \u001b[1;208H\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[1527.636332, "o", "\r\u001b[2dTeam & Persona: Pair 5 - Nomvula AgriFinance\r\u001b[3dPhase Window: From 21 August 2026\r\u001b[5d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m1. \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mWhat I did during phase 1, my primary focus was establishing the business context, regulatory framing, and threat analysis for our assigned person, Nomvula AgriFinance:\r\u001b[7d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mAnalyzed the operational realities of Nomvula AgriFinance as an agricultural micro-finance cooperative and authored the POPIA Exposure Assessment (\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36m`charter/popia_exposure.md`\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m), mapping rural data collection\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[8;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mCollaborated on structuring the project charter and defining explicit in-scope and out-of-scope boundaries to ensure zero standing cloud spend.\r\u001b[9d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mDeveloped Threat Model Version 0 (\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36m`threat-model/threat-model-v0.md`\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m), grounding our assets, actors, and entry points in Nomvula’s dominant risk theme: connectivity constraints, remote depot desks, and offli\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[10;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mCollaborated with Michael via GitHub pull requests, reviewing and merging branches through our automated CI pipeline.\r\u001b[12d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m2. \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mWhat I found hard\r\u001b[14d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mGrounding the Threat Model: Initially, our threat analysis drifted toward complex agricultural hardware (smart tractors, automated irrigation, IoT sensors). Refocusing strictly on our core persona—a financi\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[15;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mSeparating Assessment Roles: Adapting to the text-native deliverable standard required shifting away from visual representations and ensuring every deliverable was cleanly formatted Markdown accessible to s\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[16;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mGetting to know my team mate and gattering our thoughts and focusing on the work infront of us and not going out of scope.\r\u001b[18d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m3. \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mWhat i would do differently\r\u001b[20d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mTighter Collaboration on Persona Boundaries: I would establish an upfront agreement on the persona's core operational definition before researching threat vectors to prevent having to cut out-of-scope scena\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[21;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mTalk more with my team mate on what we understand we need to do and what each of us are going to be responsible for before research.\r\u001b[23d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m4. \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mWhat I Now Understand That I Did Not Before\r\u001b[25d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mTechnical Controls Require Business and Legal Justification: I now understand that technical controls like disk encryption (AES-256) and TLS mutual authentication are not merely security best practices; the\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[26;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mAccessible Evidence Standards: I experienced firsthand why text-native evidence (terminal logs, committed configuration files, \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36m`.cast`\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m recordings) provides a more verifiable, version-controlled audit trail \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[50;1H^G\u001b(B\u001b[m Help\u001b[50;18H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^O\u001b(B\u001b[m Write Out     \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^W\u001b(B\u001b[m Where Is\u001b[52G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^K\u001b(B\u001b[m Cut\u001b[50;69H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^T\u001b(B\u001b[m Execute\u001b[86G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^C\u001b(B\u001b[m Location\u001b[103G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-U\u001b(B\u001b[m Undo\u001b[50;120H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-A\u001b(B\u001b[m Set Mark     \u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-]\u001b(B\u001b[m To Bracket   \u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-Q\u001b(B\u001b[m Previous     \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^B\u001b(B\u001b[m Back\u001b[50;188H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^◂\u001b(B\u001b[m Prev Word\r\u001b[51d\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^X\u001b(B\u001b[m Exit\u001b[51;18H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^R\u001b(B\u001b[m Read File     \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^\\\u001b(B\u001b[m Replace\u001b[52G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^U\u001b(B\u001b[m Paste\u001b[51;69H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^J\u001b(B\u001b[m Justify\u001b[86G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^/\u001b(B\u001b[m Go To Line    \u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-E\u001b(B\u001b[m Redo\u001b[51;120H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-6\u001b(B\u001b[m Copy\u001b[51;137H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^Q\u001b(B\u001b[m Where Was     \u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-W\u001b(B\u001b[m Next\u001b[51;171H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^F\u001b(B\u001b[m Forward\u001b[188G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^▸\u001b(B\u001b[m Next Word\u001b[?25l\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[21;9H\u001b[?25l\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
