[1706.13487, "o", "\r\u001b[50d\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^G\u001b(B\u001b[m Help\u001b[15G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^O\u001b(B\u001b[m Write Out  \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^W\u001b(B\u001b[m Where Is   \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^K\u001b(B\u001b[m Cut\u001b[50;57H\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^T\u001b(B\u001b[m Execute    \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^C\u001b(B\u001b[m Location   \u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-U\u001b(B\u001b[m Undo\r\u001b[51d\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^X\u001b(B\u001b[m Exit\u001b[15G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^R\u001b(B\u001b[m Read File  \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^\\\u001b(B\u001b[m Replace    \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^U\u001b(B\u001b[m Paste\u001b[57G\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^J\u001b(B\u001b[m Justify    \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m^/\u001b(B\u001b[m Go To Line \u001b(B\u001b[0;7mM-E\u001b(B\u001b[m Redo"]
[1706.135381, "o", "\r\u001b[2d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[33m# Phase 1 reflection — Lutho Mathontsi\r\u001b[4d\u001b(B\u001b[0m\u001b[32m_What did I do? What did I find hard? What would I do differently? What do I understand now that I di\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[6;1H\u001b(B\u001b[mProgram: Cyber sentinel Cohort 3 (Year 2)\r\u001b[7dTeam & Persona: Pair 5 - Nomvula AgriFinance\r\u001b[8d"]
[1706.135884, "o", "Phase Window: From 21 August 2026\r\u001b[10d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m1. \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mWhat I did during phase 1, my primary focus was establishing the business context, regulatory fram\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[12;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mAnalyzed the operational realities of Nomvula AgriFinance as an agricultural micro-finance cooperat\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[13;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mCollaborated on structuring the project charter and defining explicit in-scope and out-of-scope bou\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[14;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mDeveloped Threat Model Version 0 (\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36m`threat-model/threat-model-v0.md`\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m), grounding our assets, actors,\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[15;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mCollaborated with Michael via GitHub pull requests, reviewing and merging branches through our auto\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[17;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m2. \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mWhat I found hard\r\u001b[19d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mGrounding the Threat Model: Initially, our threat analysis drifted toward complex agricultural hard\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[20;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mSeparating Assessment Roles: Adapting to the text-native deliverable standard required shifting awa\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[21;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mGetting to know my team mate and gattering our thoughts and focusing on the work infront of us and \u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[23;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m3. \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mWhat i would do differently\r\u001b[25d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mTighter Collaboration on Persona Boundaries: I would establish an upfront agreement on the persona'\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[26;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mTalk more with my team mate on what we understand we need to do and what each of us are going to be\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[28;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m4. \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mWhat I Now Understand That I Did Not Before\r\u001b[30d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mTechnical Controls Require Business and Legal Justification: I now understand that technical contro\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[31;1H\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[35m* \u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[mAccessible Evidence Standards: I experienced firsthand why text-native evidence (terminal logs, com\u001b(B\u001b[0;7m>\u001b[2;1H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
